<title>NETHERLANDS: Wolters Kluwer buys U.S. Blessing/White.</title>
<headline>Wolters Kluwer buys U.S. Blessing/White.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch publisher Wolters Kluwer NV said on Thursday it had agreed to buy Blessing/White Inc in the U.S.</p>
<p>&quot;Blessing/White ... is a leading provider of individual and organisational performance and development training in the United States and the United Kingdom,&quot; the Dutch group said in a statement.</p>
<p>No financial details of the transaction were disclosed.</p>
</text>
